"Š 1998 Mario Weilguni (mweilguni@kde.org)\n"
"\n"
"kpm is the KDE version of qps, written by Matthias\n"
"Engdegĺrd. The port to KDE was done by Mario\n"
"Weilguni. If you are interested on the original\n"
